        <mxCell id="boundary" value="Reuse valid setup and evidence; call API-03 only for missing setup. Reuse a suitable certificate; each platform needs its own checks.&#10;Setup only preserves any selection; if none exists, it activates none. Confirm scoped readiness after assessing the access evidence.&#10;Keep earlier invoices linked to their original route. Private A to Private B stays disabled.&#10;Operator interconnection is separate from customer setup. Full rules and acceptance checks remain in SPEC038 §7." style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
